<i>How should I fight you?</i>

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.830
Clinical 
Ophthalmology

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.830
Neuro-Ophthalmology

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.830
<i>His eyes are his weakness...</i>

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.710
